{"parse": {"title": "冰原时隙-05", "pageid": 107412, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-04\" title=\"冰原时隙-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冰原时隙-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-06\" title=\"冰原时隙-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冰原时隙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E4.B8.AA.E6.89.BF.E8.AF.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一个承诺\">一个承诺</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一个承诺</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Promise</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出于必要的警惕，中尉对探索小组的分队进行了重编。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>就是这个方向吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524802.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-524802.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524802.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524802.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-524802.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524802.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-524802.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524802.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>红色泰坦可以用它肚皮上的底绒发誓，中尉，别在南极质疑企鹅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>要让你的大兵们过来汇合吗？杰克老弟可以帮你送信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>再往前探索看看，你们说的营地离这里还有多远？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我没有不信任各位的意思，但在南极，每一次调动的命令都必须格外谨慎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>好吧，好吧。当然，我完全可以理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠用力地点了点头，摊开双爪，黑眼珠灵活地动了动。如果它是人类的话，恐怕正在翻一个极不雅观的白眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>看到前面那座冰山了吗，我们会带着你绕过去。人类的驻扎痕迹就在那里，一眼就能看见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>很感谢你的理解，嚼嚼松果先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉低头看了看手表，距离戴维德失踪已经过去了三十三个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她沿着松鼠指示的方向，与未能全心托付后背的战友一起，踏上最新被规划出的第四条路线。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在所有规划和计算中显示最可能与重塑之手遭遇的路线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我个人非常感激你的帮助和你为此承担的风险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>别这么说，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我们自己走也不安全，至少你还带了家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我更希望不会遇到需要使用武器的场景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰原上的跋涉艰辛而又枯燥，但中尉习惯了沉默的行军，很快带领着队伍进入了专注的奔袭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>呃，你不想聊点什么吗，中尉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>为了保持体力，我的建议是不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>哦……好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>如果你愿意，我们可以在适当的时间和地点进行一场放松的闲谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>听起来不错，是那种会有无限供应的果汁的地方吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>你看，出来久了，有时候也会觉得佛罗里达不那么坏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>说起来，中尉，你是在哪里认识我的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是第二次被问起。中尉低下头看着自己的手，圣保罗的热风曾经握在这只手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你上过报纸。我过去……听人提起过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>在北美洲趣闻版。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>噢……但那也是上了报纸不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉顿时提高了警惕，松鼠也难得严肃了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>咱们到了，中尉，就是那里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_zhudi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_zhudi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凌乱的临时驻地，散落的完好补给，所有的一切都昭示着情况不容乐观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>确认过物资上的标记，莫莉德尔立刻拿出笔记本，很快用约定密文写好了三封短讯，分给三只企鹅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>辛苦你们了。放在标记地点就可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>放心吧中尉，使命必达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>说起来，那咱们现在要干什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔正在比对着地图，速记铅笔在地图上划出“沙沙”声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>时间已经不多了，请允许我再次请求你的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你可以拒绝，因为这很危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉看着靠近笔尖的那只手掌，诚挚地看向她的松鼠伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>无论如何，你都已经赢得莫莉德尔的友谊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我承诺，在合适的时候，我会竭尽全力送你和你的企鹅朋友们离开这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>即使我无法履行这一承诺，我的战友们也会帮我完成。以军人的荣誉起誓，我的许诺永远有效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>……你说无法履行是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这么危险吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我不确定，这是最坏打算。上战场之前，总得做些最坏打算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我可能……我是说，很感谢你的承诺？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>你刚才是不是说，我可以拒绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉点了点头，从工具包中取出一张早就准备好的文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你能看懂地图吗？在这个位置等待我的同伴白手套队长，他会安排好你们的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>那你呢，中尉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔看了看手表，又看了看远方笼罩在冰山阴影下的雪原。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我必须把我的队员们带回来，这是我接到的命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这样的话，好吧。祝你好运，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔对它的祝福致以感激，在废弃驻地留下标记后，独自走进了雪原里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠点了点头，拿着中尉给它的证明，站在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>看啊，一位英雄，正要为了她的同伴，独自踏上危险的征程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>而你只是一只松鼠，伙计。你只能听懂动物说话，甚至听不懂那些面具怪人喷油。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>但说真的，不在南极，我们还能去哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它又看了一眼手里的证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>可是她叫我“先生”诶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它扔下证明，飞快地追了上去。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冰原时隙-05"}}